{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lost Resolve is a love letter to speedrunning, featuring a tight movement system that is simple to learn and difficult to master. Whether you're a seasoned pro or a complete beginner, you'll quickly find yourself saying,<i> &quot;yeah, I could have done that faster,&quot;</i> and going for another run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990840/extras/ezgif-512b69defc25d9.gif?t=1750710889\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Here's what you've got to look forward to:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A synergistic set of movement abilities that flow together seamlessly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12 action stages and an interconnected hub world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging boss encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Potential for game-breaking shortcuts and high-skill maneuvers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockable abilities to fine-tune your movement kit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A heartfelt story and soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless speedrunning fun</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>So rise up, Soul. Melody needs your help...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2990840?t=1750710889","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2990840?t=1750710889","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990840/286467fbad20e8f6536614d88c10b9ec1eaa9cbf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750710889","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990840/286467fbad20e8f6536614d88c10b9ec1eaa9cbf/capsu